target: skills/review/review-loop/plan.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./plan.test.sh
expect: FAIL  a failed threat-model report plans the update
why:    a failed `looper threat-model` (an unreadable ledger, an uncheckable pin) reads as an existing model with nothing stale, so the update agent is skipped exactly when the model could not be read
